{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Strange Brew Demo features levels 1 and 2 as well as the tutorial. Jump in for a quick taste of what awaits you in the complete coffee fueled zombie experience coming in 2026.<br><br>Strange Brew is a 3D action platformer with an arcade feel. Risk death as you dodge and dash to the safety of the next MoonDucks coffee shop. Activate traps that cause blood and feathers. Test your reflexes to avoid the relentless zombie onslaught.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055220/extras/bec50826304b37a5af77c2f62e7ad516.poster.avif?t=1758741196\" width=616 height=247 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055220/extras/bec50826304b37a5af77c2f62e7ad516.webm?t=1758741196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>RUN FROM THE DECAFFEINATED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop or throw coffee beans to lure and trick zombie hordes. Be clever. To top the leaderboard, Joe must take risks to orchestrate mass murders for monster point totals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055220/extras/4d74d9f71a2adc029895e1631a4d0f7b.poster.avif?t=1758741196\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055220/extras/4d74d9f71a2adc029895e1631a4d0f7b.webm?t=1758741196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055220/extras/4d74d9f71a2adc029895e1631a4d0f7b.mp4?t=1758741196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KILL \u2018EM ALL, IF YOU MUST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect to 